10. In view of these circumstances, in line with the law laid down by the Supreme Court in Gian Singh vs. State of Punjab &amp;
Anr.: (2012) 10 SCC 303 as also in Narinder Singh &amp; Ors. vs. State of Punjab &amp; Anr.:
(2014) 6 SCC 466, this Court sees no reason why the subject FIR and all proceedings emanating therefrom should not be quashed.

